{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_004_03_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:3bf446d55f40d76667707ee45a401d81d9c0b5d013098243151e938f373d4c18",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_b:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:50df62d2d6c895c9c1d270e58149e1377495f547a63fff87823d70f7ce2566bb",
      "text": "偶像有好多好多……！好厉害！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_b:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4a03ef5bace839fcb9b6d5b653ddd2d5828d1696104d3af5c9a97f17e2dbaa99",
      "text": "真不愧是你，懂得真多啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_b:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6f6fdf56c33cecf4a70e78ce21f8562791937d1fbc6e7d531b9a0c4025553c76",
      "text": "谢谢夸奖，两位。\n那么，关于“我们该怎么做”嘛……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_b:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b9cba9f4b4f414452a9633d40108a29aed029f0306471fbf98fdcfa588e8efef",
      "text": "我觉得一开始果然还是应该先了解最基础的东西。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_b:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aee51246559b3bdef21b3e36780966b76fceb7cddc7d3e706cb4c1bfaa1c86ba",
      "text": "偶像究竟是怎么一回事，\n由我们自己去亲身体会非常重要。所以……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_b:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:000c204b9087f749fc45845996db5281d9c85ad710c85a9acab6ac715f753bab",
      "text": "我们就先去直接参加一次\n偶像事务所的试镜试试看吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_b:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0803f9c3804a9f287c6770dd3663894a84a979bdbebec57db76567e411ad3e81",
      "text": "试、试镜吗……\n就跟面试差不多吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_b:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1df694b836170b8bb2101d670bb913ac6f3997eea6645cfd3250ec1c59baec2f",
      "text": "哦——……！我参加过人偶装的面试。\n偶像的面试我也能加油！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_b:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:58f65a7592f3c39b03c580d74859dbe34e6224fa88a90df45891eb31dc083b2b",
      "text": "实。偶像的面试要怎么参加？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_b:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:77856847555cf5ca234ff9a30a5413138c2db84407ce4e836befa1ab4cd78f2d",
      "text": "和打工一样，杂志上有详细的招募信息哦。\n看，就像这样。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_b:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0ae84700026dbba35c95b76f88b2b39abb24f05615c6c5ab981fec7217a4b7ba",
      "text": "偶像事务所的网站上也可能会有，\n就由我把信息整理出来吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_b:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3f26e12abb55d06957c9905a80283d61e6642f0443557dfc18408ec10331786e",
      "text": "那么……就等实先生的消息了。\n明天同一时间再集合吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
